WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.613
Your project's in. Now let's get it ready for the shop floor.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.956
First, the drawing. Open Documents.

00:00:08.306 --> 00:00:10.699
Find your drawing in the list, and click it.

00:00:11.049 --> 00:00:14.049
Hit Approve. Your name and the date are saved with it.

00:00:16.049 --> 00:00:19.304
Next, the material. Head over to Purchasing.

00:00:19.654 --> 00:00:23.208
Find the material for your project, and hit Order by email.

00:00:23.558 --> 00:00:27.348
The order's already written for you. Give it a read, then send it.

00:00:27.948 --> 00:00:30.759
When the supplier says yes, mark it Confirmed.

00:00:32.709 --> 00:00:36.057
Drawing approved, material on its way. Nice.

